# Code-only graphify run: every docs, paper, image and video file is ignored below,
# so graphify extracts code with its local AST parser and makes no LLM calls.
#
# Scope: the framework and GUI source.
# - Framework/ and scripts/ (installed whole, minus test/) make up the `mantid`
#   conda package (conda/recipes/mantid), which configures with
#   MANTID_FRAMEWORK_LIB=BUILD, MANTID_QT_LIB=OFF, ENABLE_WORKBENCH=OFF and ENABLE_DOCS=OFF.
# - qt/ is the GUI code, packaged as mantidqt and mantidworkbench.

# Allowlist: ignore every top-level entry, then re-include the ones in scope
/*
!/Framework/
!/scripts/
!/qt/

